# An M20 screw thread made through its screen on an extruded circle,
# turned 120° about its axis and fading out 4 mm before its end. The
# same model as path_thread_runout_phase.go makes
# (TestPathEquivalence/thread_runout_phase).
key c
move 300 300
down L 300 300
up L 300 300
move 350 300
down L 350 300
up L 350 300
key esc
key x shift
move 350 300
down L 350 300
up L 350 300
menu Features|Screw Thread...
# The phase, the run-out, then flip the direction, down into the part,
# and make it.
twmove 426 150
twdown L 426 150
twup L 426 150
edit 120
twmove 487 170
twdown L 487 170
twup L 487 170
edit 4
twmove 60 230
twdown L 60 230
twup L 60 230
twmove 37 260
twdown L 37 260
twup L 37 260
